{"id": "86177", "name": "משוואה לינארית עם סוגריים – סכום שני ביטויים שווה 0 (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Solve the following equation for {{CT:0}}:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:1}} = 0. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\({{CT:2}}\\) = [[input:ans]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> The objective is to get the equation into the form \\({{CT:2}} = p\\) where \\(p\\) is a rational number. To obtain \\({{CT:2}}\\) on one side of the equation it may be necessary to under-take several operations which must be performed on both sides of the equation.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Expanding the brackets</b><br>In this example:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:1}} = 0. \\]</p>We are first required to expand the brackets and collect like terms:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:3}} = 0. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Moving the constants</b><br>Then move the constants to one side keeping the variables on the other:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:4}} = {{CT:5}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — Dividing by the coefficient</b><br>Then divide by the coefficient of \\({{CT:2}}\\) (\\({{CT:6}}\\)). And so we now have obtained a value for {{CT:0}}:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:2}} = {{CT:7}}. \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["b1", "b2", "cf1", "cf2", "k1", "k2", "ta", "v"], "nvariants": 50}